OL,3,GNEWSAWarehouse fire breaks out at
OL,4,Aformer airfield
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmergency services were called to a
OL,7,Flarge warehouse fire near Melton
OL,8,FMowbray on Monday.
OL,10,FDalby Road in Melton Mowbray was shut
OL,11,Fby Leicestershire Police at about 21:30
OL,12,FBST while fire crews tackled the blaze
OL,13,Fat the former Melton Airfield.
OL,15,FThe force asked people to avoid the
OL,16,Farea due to the incident.
OL,18,FResidents nearby were told to close
OL,19,Fdoors and windows.
